<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Art thou weary, tender heart?</l><l>Oh, be glad of pain;</l><l>Sweetest things in sorrow grow</l><l>As the flow’rs in rain.</l><l>God is watching, thou’lt have sun</l><l>When the clouds their work have done.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
